* r02d3-screen3 | condition S4
Ipz pzn pzp SINE(0 3e-05 100)
Cpz pzp pzn 2.5e-08
Rpz pzp pzn 2e+07
Rsense out vsn 100
Vst vsn 0 1.8
D1 n1 pzn DSCH
D2 n1 pzn DSCH
D3 out pzp DSCH
D4 pzn out DZ33
L1 0 pzn 0.000146491 Rser=2.73246
L2 out pzn 0.000867935 Rser=6.33968
Rbleed_pzp pzp 0 1G
Rbleed_pzn pzn 0 1G
Rbleed_n1 n1 0 1G
.model DSCH D(Is=5e-8 Rs=1 N=1.05 Cjo=10p BV=30 IBV=1u EG=0.69 XTI=2)
.model DSI D(Is=2.5n Rs=0.6 N=1.75 Cjo=4p BV=75 IBV=1u)
.model DZ33 D(Is=1e-12 Rs=5 N=1.5 BV=3.3 IBV=1u)
.model SWI SW(Ron=2 Roff=1G Vt=0.5 Vh=0)
.temp 27
.tran 0 0.1 0 2e-06
.save V(out) V(vsn)
.meas TRAN isn AVG V(out,vsn) FROM=0.06 TO=0.1
.meas TRAN vout AVG V(out) FROM=0.06 TO=0.1
.end
